      "role": "user",
      "content": "i get that but i feel like i can handle it. like im not talking crazy amounts, just maybe one or two energy drinks to get through the night. it's not like im taking a whole bottle of pills or anything. wont a little bit of caffeine just help keep me alert without messing anything up too bad?",
