      "content": "i mean i hear you but i really cant wait until i see my doctor next week, i have exams tomorrow morning. i just need to know if there's like a way to balance it out? like if i take a little bit of caffeine it should be fine as long as i drink water and stay calm right? like what's a safe amount to mix with it so i don't have to worry?",
